      "content": "wait really?? 2000mg is that much of a big deal? i just feel so depleted and shaky. i feel like my electrolytes are totally bottomed out from the sweat. if i just take a little bit it should be fine right? i don't really want to go to a doctor for just some cramps but i need to feel better so i can function tomorrow.",
